WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
There are moments when the world changes. We live in one.

2
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.040
In a few years, when you leave the Yeshiva, the world will work differently.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.980
The way to work, earn a living, influence, will be completely different from what your parents knew.

4
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.400
And this world has a language, English, and there are tools, artificial intelligence.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.960
But be aware, technology is not the best.

6
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.180
Technology today is like electricity, everyone has it.

7
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.300
The question is what you build with it.

8
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.780
This is what is done at Impact Lev, from a turn to a real impact.

9
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:38.600
Teams of four, real problem, one year, one hundred percent in English.

10
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.860
Identify a problem, in the field, in the community, in the Jewish world or in the market.

11
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:48.160
interviewing real people, building a product, selling it,

12
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:53.120
and present it in full blood, in front of the parents, in front of the Yeshiva, in front of the world.

13
00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.680
And what do you get out of it?

14
00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.220
English that works, not for the exam, for life.

15
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.380
Confidence to stand in front of an audience, team, product and first customer.

16
00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:05.460
Now, why are you?

17
00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:09.480
Because you excel in English at the yeshiva, and this is mandatory.

18
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.360
Not only in language, motivation and behavior.

19
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.460
A good entrepreneur is above all organized, arrives on time, keeps his word,

20
00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.380
Respects the team, finishes what is started.

21
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.840
Without it, there is no enterprise and no impact.

22
00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.840
And they made me a temple and I lived in them.

23
00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:32.340
Every good thing that is built honestly is an apartment there, in this world.

24
00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.800
Ready to build your world?

25
00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.740
They start after Sukkot.
